1	Query_1[1]	Specific	99777	2446	2610	5.90383e-09	53.6924	cd06170	LuxR_C_like	-	532797
1	Query_1[3]	Non-specific	507226	3	1493	0	1021.94	NF007399	PRK09928	N	-
1	Query_1[-1]	Specific	440348	3555	4406	7.48505e-41	151.943	COG0583	LysR	-	-
1	Query_1[-3]	Specific	517306	4564	4995	2.01694e-14	71.8738	pfam06496	DUF1097	-	-
